<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: If this creature is injured, it will return to its connected Anima Nexus tree and enter a woody healing pod. After {DAYS} days, the dryad will emerge with its wounds healed.-->
  <CommandHealInHealingPodDesc>如果该生物受伤，它将返回与其相连的阿尼玛连结树并进入木质治疗舱。 {DAYS} 天后，树精的伤口将会愈合。</CommandHealInHealingPodDesc>
</LanguageData>
